Description: Python Client SDK for the Mistral AI API
 mistralai is the official Python client library for the Mistral AI
 platform API, providing typed access to chat completions, embeddings,
 fine-tuning, agents, and other Mistral AI services.
 .
 This package provides the base runtime (chat, embeddings, files, OCR,
 fine-tuning, etc.); optional extras for GCP/Azure auth, agents (MCP),
 realtime (websockets) and telemetry export are not packaged and require
 their dependencies to be installed separately via pip if needed.
